AILANG Parse v0.8.0 Release Notes
==================================

Release date: 2 April 2026

What's New
----------

1. EML/MBOX Email Parsing (NEW FORMAT)
   - RFC 5322 header extraction (From, To, Subject, Date, CC, BCC)
   - Multipart MIME support (text/plain, text/html, attachments)
   - Base64 and quoted-printable decoding
   - MBOX format: multiple messages in one file
   - Folded headers and encoded (RFC 2047) subjects

2. Upgraded Sample Files (15 -> 22 samples)
   - 7 DOCX samples covering formatting, footnotes, hyperlinks,
     track changes, comments, tables, and a real-world complex doc
   - 3 XLSX samples: merged cells, formulas, number formats
   - 2 PPTX samples: speaker notes, rich formatting
   - New CSV with format capability matrix
   - New HTML getting started guide
   - New Markdown architecture overview
   - Alice in Wonderland EPUB (Project Gutenberg)

3. WASM Demo Improvements
   - 13 demo buttons (was 10)
   - Tooltips describing features tested by each sample
   - New HTML, Markdown, and CSV samples parse in-browser

Breaking Changes
----------------

Sample ID renames (update your scripts):
  sample_docx_basic    -> sample_docx_formatting
  sample_pptx_show     -> sample_pptx_notes
  sample_xlsx_basic    -> sample_xlsx_merged

The old IDs will return 404 from /api/v1/parse.

Performance
-----------

Format        | Files | Time   | Per file
--------------+-------+--------+---------
DOCX          |     5 |  26ms  |   5.2ms
PPTX          |     3 |  18ms  |   6.0ms
XLSX          |     3 |  12ms  |   4.0ms
HTML          |     1 |   3ms  |   3.0ms
CSV           |     1 |   1ms  |   1.0ms
Markdown      |     1 |   2ms  |   2.0ms
EPUB (Alice)  |     1 |  45ms  |  45.0ms
EML           |     1 |   2ms  |   2.0ms

All deterministic. No AI calls needed.

Upgrade
-------

  pip install --upgrade ailang-parse
  npm update @sunholo/ailang-parse
  go get -u github.com/sunholo-data/ailang-parse-go

Full changelog: https://github.com/sunholo-data/ailang-parse/compare/v0.7.0...v0.8.0

Happy parsing!
The AILANG Team

